  "eidolon.codex.entry.shadow_communion.description": "Commune with Nyxathel the Shadow Lord through dark rituals. This chant opens a direct communication channel with the deity of shadows.",
  "eidolon.codex.entry.shadow_patronage_ritual": "A dangerous ritual to establish connection with Nyxathel, the Shadow Lord.",
  "eidolon.codex.entry.shadow_patronage_ritual.description": "A dangerous ritual to establish connection with Nyxathel, the Shadow Lord.",
  "eidolon.codex.entry.shadow_patronage_ritual.effects": "Successfully completing this ritual grants Shadow Patronage and allows communion with Nyxathel.",
